  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "Bruce, serious question. How much money do you actually have?",
      "durationSeconds": 3.4,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-01.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "BRUCE, SERIOUS QUESTION. HOW",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.7
        },
        {
          "text": "MUCH MONEY DO YOU ACTUALLY HAVE?",
          "start": 1.7,
          "end": 3.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "I have enough.",
      "durationSeconds": 1.6,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-02.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "I HAVE ENOUGH.",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "That's not a number. People say you're a billionaire, but you crashed three Batwings this year alone. Those have to be, what, a hundred million dollars each?",
      "durationSeconds": 8.2,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-03.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "THAT'S NOT A NUMBER. YOU",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.0
        },
        {
          "text": "CRASHED THREE BATWINGS THIS YEAR.",
          "start": 2.0,
          "end": 4.1
        },
        {
          "text": "THOSE HAVE TO BE WHAT, A",
          "start": 4.1,
          "end": 6.1
        },
        {
          "text": "HUNDRED MILLION DOLLARS EACH?",
          "start": 6.1,
          "end": 8.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "85 million, but the manufacturing costs are heavily subsidized by Wayne Aerospace military contracts. It is an acceptable loss margin.",
      "durationSeconds": 7.6,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-04.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "85 MILLION. MANUFACTURING COSTS",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.5
        },
        {
          "text": "ARE SUBSIDIZED BY WAYNE AERO.",
          "start": 2.5,
          "end": 5.0
        },
        {
          "text": "IT'S AN ACCEPTABLE LOSS MARGIN.",
          "start": 5.0,
          "end": 7.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "Acceptable loss? Bruce, you basically burn the GDP of a small country every weekend. Just practically speaking, could you buy Gotham?",
      "durationSeconds": 7.2,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-05.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "ACCEPTABLE LOSS? YOU BURN",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.4
        },
        {
          "text": "THE GDP OF A SMALL COUNTRY.",
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.8
        },
        {
          "text": "COULD YOU JUST BUY GOTHAM?",
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 7.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "I already own 38% of the commercial real estate in the city.",
      "durationSeconds": 4.2,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-06.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "I ALREADY OWN 38 PERCENT",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.1
        },
        {
          "text": "OF GOTHAM'S COMMERCIAL REALTY.",
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "Wait, seriously? You're telling me you just casually buy up skyscrapers? Why? To make a profit?",
      "durationSeconds": 5.8,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-07.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "WAIT, SERIOUSLY? YOU CASUALLY",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.9
        },
        {
          "text": "BUY UP SKYSCRAPERS FOR PROFIT?",
          "start": 2.9,
          "end": 5.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "No, it's a tactical necessity. Owning the buildings bypasses city zoning laws. It allows me to install reinforced grappling points, hidden server hubs, and automated Batmobile repair base without municipal oversight.",
      "durationSeconds": 10.4,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-08.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "NO. IT BYPASSES ZONING LAWS.",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.6
        },
        {
          "text": "ALLOWS REINFORCED GRAPPLE POINTS,",
          "start": 2.6,
          "end": 5.2
        },
        {
          "text": "HIDDEN SERVER HUBS, AND",
          "start": 5.2,
          "end": 7.8
        },
        {
          "text": "REPAIR BAYS WITHOUT OVERSIGHT.",
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 10.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "So, while the rest of the world is investing in stocks, you're buying hundred million dollar high-rises just to glue stone gargoyles onto them so you can swing around easier.",
      "durationSeconds": 8.4,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-09.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "SO YOU BUY HIGH-RISES JUST",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.8
        },
        {
          "text": "TO GLUE STONE GARGOYLES ON THEM",
          "start": 2.8,
          "end": 5.6
        },
        {
          "text": "SO YOU CAN SWING AROUND EASIER?!",
          "start": 5.6,
          "end": 8.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "Modern architecture is tactically inefficient, Tim. Someone had to fix it.",
      "durationSeconds": 4.6,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-10.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "MODERN ARCHITECTURE IS",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.3
        },
        {
          "text": "INEFFICIENT. SOMEONE HAD TO FIX IT.",
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 4.6
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
